      "css": ".ds-header{font-family:Geist,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:48px;padding:0 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(34 34 46);background:rgb(17 17 24/0.8);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);font-size:14px}.ds-crumb{color:rgb(232 232 240)}.ds-sep{color:rgb(140 140 160/0.6)}.ds-page{color:rgb(232 232 240);font-weight:500}.ds-status{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:32px;padding:0 6px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;font-family:'Geist Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;color:rgb(140 140 160);cursor:pointer}.ds-status:hover{background:rgb(22 22 31);color:rgb(232 232 240)}.ds-run{color:rgb(124 106 247)}.ds-need{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;background:#f7a26a}.ds-live{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;background:rgb(140 140 160)}.ds-bot{color:rgb(124 106 247)}.ds-ink{color:rgb(232 232 240)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Agent Status Strip",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "agent-status",
      "description": "Header strip that leads the shell: neutral connection dot (Pencil Grey when connected, amber + \"Reconnecting…\" when down, no separator after it), then terminal agents working (Bot glyph, count in text ink, pulse only with motion allowed), then chats running (muted) / need you / recent errors (last 24h, not dismissed; counts in text ink); zero counts drop out. Click opens the head of the attention queue (need-you, then actionable errors), else /chat.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-status\"><span class=\"ds-live\"></span><span class=\"ds-bot\">▣</span><span class=\"ds-ink\">2 agents working</span><span class=\"ds-sep\">·</span><span class=\"ds-run\">◌</span>1 running<span class=\"ds-sep\">·</span><span class=\"ds-need\"></span><span class=\"ds-ink\">1 need you</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-status{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:32px;padding:0 6px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;font-family:'Geist Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;color:rgb(140 140 160);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms,color 120ms}.ds-status:hover{background:rgb(22 22 31);color:rgb(232 232 240)}.ds-status:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgb(124 106 247)}.ds-live{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;background:rgb(140 140 160)}.ds-bot{color:rgb(124 106 247)}.ds-ink{color:rgb(232 232 240)}.ds-run{color:rgb(124 106 247)}.ds-need{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;background:#f7a26a}.ds-sep{color:rgb(140 140 160/0.6)}"
    }
