        "body": "Theme and accent colours are defined as RGB triplets on `:root` / `.dark` / `html[data-accent]`, and consumed only through Tailwind tokens (`bg-accent/20`, `border-border2`). Never hard-code a hex in a component.",
        "section": "colors"
